{"task_id": "Mbpp/47", "original_task_id": 47, "entry_point": "compute_Last_Digit", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the last digit when factorial of a divides factorial of b.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef compute_Last_Digit(A, B):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the last digit when factorial of a divides factorial of b.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def compute_Last_Digit(A,B): \r\n    variable = 1\r\n    if (A == B): \r\n        return 1\r\n    elif ((B - A) >= 5):  \r\n        return 0\r\n    else:   \r\n        for i in range(A + 1,B + 1): \r\n            variable = (variable * (i % 10)) % 10\r\n        return variable % 10", "tests": "assert compute_Last_Digit(2,4) == 2\nassert compute_Last_Digit(6,8) == 6\nassert compute_Last_Digit(1,2) == 2", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/48", "original_task_id": 48, "entry_point": "odd_bit_set_number", "prompt": "Write a python function to set all odd bits of a given number.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef odd_bit_set_number(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to set all odd bits of a given number.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def odd_bit_set_number(n):\r\n    count = 0;res = 0;temp = n\r\n    while temp > 0:\r\n        if count % 2 == 0:\r\n            res |= (1 << count)\r\n        count += 1\r\n        temp >>= 1\r\n    return (n | res)", "tests": "assert odd_bit_set_number(10) == 15\nassert odd_bit_set_number(20) == 21\nassert odd_bit_set_number(30) == 31", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
