{"task_id": "Mbpp/83", "original_task_id": 83, "entry_point": "get_Char", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the character made by adding all the characters of the given string.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef get_Char(strr):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the character made by adding all the characters of the given string.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def get_Char(strr):  \r\n    summ = 0\r\n    for i in range(len(strr)): \r\n        summ += (ord(strr[i]) - ord('a') + 1)  \r\n    if (summ % 26 == 0): \r\n        return ord('z') \r\n    else: \r\n        summ = summ % 26\r\n        return chr(ord('a') + summ - 1)", "tests": "assert get_Char(\"abc\") == \"f\"\nassert get_Char(\"gfg\") == \"t\"\nassert get_Char(\"ab\") == \"c\"", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
