{"task_id": "Mbpp/134", "original_task_id": 134, "entry_point": "check_last", "prompt": "Write a python function to check whether the last element of given array is even or odd after performing an operation p times.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef check_last(arr, n, p):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to check whether the last element of given array is even or odd after performing an operation p times.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def check_last (arr,n,p): \r\n    _sum = 0\r\n    for i in range(n): \r\n        _sum = _sum + arr[i] \r\n    if p == 1: \r\n        if _sum % 2 == 0: \r\n            return \"ODD\"\r\n        else: \r\n            return \"EVEN\"\r\n    return \"EVEN\"\r\n      ", "tests": "assert check_last([5,7,10],3,1) == \"ODD\"\nassert check_last([2,3],2,3) == \"EVEN\"\nassert check_last([1,2,3],3,1) == \"ODD\"", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
