{"task_id": "Mbpp/169", "original_task_id": 169, "entry_point": "get_pell", "prompt": "Write a function to calculate the nth pell number.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef get_pell(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to calculate the nth pell number.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def get_pell(n): \r\n\tif (n <= 2): \r\n\t\treturn n \r\n\ta = 1\r\n\tb = 2\r\n\tfor i in range(3, n+1): \r\n\t\tc = 2 * b + a \r\n\t\ta = b \r\n\t\tb = c \r\n\treturn b ", "tests": "assert get_pell(4) == 12\nassert get_pell(7) == 169\nassert get_pell(8) == 408", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "original_task_id": 170, "entry_point": "sum_range_list", "prompt": "Write a function to find sum of the numbers in a list between the indices of a specified range.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sum_range_list(list1, m, n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to find sum of the numbers in a list between the indices of a specified range.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def sum_range_list(list1, m, n):                                                                                                                                                                                                \r\n    sum_range = 0                                                                                                                                                                                                         \r\n    for i in range(m, n+1, 1):                                                                                                                                                                                        \r\n        sum_range += list1[i]                                                                                                                                                                                                  \r\n    return sum_range   ", "tests": "assert sum_range_list( [2,1,5,6,8,3,4,9,10,11,8,12],8,10)==29\nassert sum_range_list( [2,1,5,6,8,3,4,9,10,11,8,12],5,7)==16\nassert sum_range_list( [2,1,5,6,8,3,4,9,10,11,8,12],7,10)==38", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
