{"task_id": "Mbpp/177", "original_task_id": 177, "entry_point": "answer", "prompt": "Write a python function to find two distinct numbers such that their lcm lies within the given range.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef answer(L, R):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find two distinct numbers such that their lcm lies within the given range.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def answer(L,R): \r\n    if (2 * L <= R): \r\n        return (L ,2*L)\r\n    else: \r\n        return (-1) ", "tests": "assert answer(3,8) == (3,6)\nassert answer(2,6) == (2,4)\nassert answer(1,3) == (1,2)", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
