{"task_id": "Mbpp/280", "original_task_id": 280, "entry_point": "sequential_search", "prompt": "Write a function to search an element in the given array by using sequential search.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sequential_search(dlist, item):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to search an element in the given array by using sequential search.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def sequential_search(dlist, item):\r\n    pos = 0\r\n    found = False\r\n    while pos < len(dlist) and not found:\r\n        if dlist[pos] == item:\r\n            found = True\r\n        else:\r\n            pos = pos + 1\r\n    return found, pos", "tests": "assert sequential_search([11,23,58,31,56,77,43,12,65,19],31) == (True, 3)\nassert sequential_search([12, 32, 45, 62, 35, 47, 44, 61],61) == (True, 7)\nassert sequential_search([9, 10, 17, 19, 22, 39, 48, 56],48) == (True, 6)", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/281", "original_task_id": 281, "entry_point": "all_unique", "prompt": "Write a python function to check if the elements of a given list are unique or not.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef all_unique(test_list):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to check if the elements of a given list are unique or not.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def all_unique(test_list):\r\n    if len(test_list) > len(set(test_list)):\r\n        return False\r\n    return True", "tests": "assert all_unique([1,2,3]) == True\nassert all_unique([1,2,1,2]) == False\nassert all_unique([1,2,3,4,5]) == True", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/282", "original_task_id": 282, "entry_point": "sub_list", "prompt": "Write a function to substaract two lists using map and lambda function.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sub_list(nums1, nums2):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to substaract two lists using map and lambda function.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def sub_list(nums1,nums2):\r\n  result = map(lambda x, y: x - y, nums1, nums2)\r\n  return list(result)", "tests": "assert sub_list([1, 2, 3],[4,5,6])==[-3,-3,-3]\nassert sub_list([1,2],[3,4])==[-2,-2]\nassert sub_list([90,120],[50,70])==[40,50]", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "original_task_id": 283, "entry_point": "validate", "prompt": "Write a python function to check whether the frequency of each digit is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef validate(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to check whether the frequency of each digit is less than or equal to the digit itself.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def validate(n): \r\n    for i in range(10): \r\n        temp = n;  \r\n        count = 0; \r\n        while (temp): \r\n            if (temp % 10 == i): \r\n                count+=1;  \r\n            if (count > i): \r\n                return False\r\n            temp //= 10; \r\n    return True", "tests": "assert validate(1234) == True\nassert validate(51241) == False\nassert validate(321) == True", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
