{"task_id": "Mbpp/291", "original_task_id": 291, "entry_point": "count_no_of_ways", "prompt": "Write a function to find out the number of ways of painting the fence such that at most 2 adjacent posts have the same color for the given fence with n posts and k colors.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef count_no_of_ways(n, k):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to find out the number of ways of painting the fence such that at most 2 adjacent posts have the same color for the given fence with n posts and k colors.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def count_no_of_ways(n, k): \r\n\tdp = [0] * (n + 1) \r\n\ttotal = k \r\n\tmod = 1000000007\r\n\tdp[1] = k \r\n\tdp[2] = k * k\t \r\n\tfor i in range(3,n+1): \r\n\t\tdp[i] = ((k - 1) * (dp[i - 1] + dp[i - 2])) % mod \r\n\treturn dp[n]", "tests": "assert count_no_of_ways(2, 4) == 16\nassert count_no_of_ways(3, 2) == 6\nassert count_no_of_ways(4, 4) == 228", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
