{"task_id": "Mbpp/331", "original_task_id": 331, "entry_point": "count_unset_bits", "prompt": "Write a python function to count unset bits of a given number.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef count_unset_bits(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to count unset bits of a given number.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def count_unset_bits(n): \r\n    count = 0\r\n    x = 1\r\n    while(x < n + 1): \r\n        if ((x & n) == 0): \r\n            count += 1\r\n        x = x << 1\r\n    return count  ", "tests": "assert count_unset_bits(2) == 1\nassert count_unset_bits(4) == 2\nassert count_unset_bits(6) == 1", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
