{"task_id": "Mbpp/433", "original_task_id": 433, "entry_point": "check_greater", "prompt": "Write a function to check whether the entered number is greater than the elements of the given array.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef check_greater(arr, number):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to check whether the entered number is greater than the elements of the given array.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def check_greater(arr, number):\r\n  arr.sort()\r\n  if number > arr[-1]:\r\n    return ('Yes, the entered number is greater than those in the array')\r\n  else:\r\n    return ('No, entered number is less than those in the array')", "tests": "assert check_greater([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 4) == 'No, entered number is less than those in the array'\nassert check_greater([2, 3, 4, 5, 6], 8) == 'Yes, the entered number is greater than those in the array'\nassert check_greater([9, 7, 4, 8, 6, 1], 11) == 'Yes, the entered number is greater than those in the array'", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/434", "original_task_id": 434, "entry_point": "text_match_one", "prompt": "Write a function that matches a string that has an a followed by one or more b's.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef text_match_one(text):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function that matches a string that has an a followed by one or more b's.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "import re\r\ndef text_match_one(text):\r\n        patterns = 'ab+?'\r\n        if re.search(patterns,  text):\r\n                return 'Found a match!'\r\n        else:\r\n                return('Not matched!')\r\n", "tests": "assert text_match_one(\"ac\")==('Not matched!')\nassert text_match_one(\"dc\")==('Not matched!')\nassert text_match_one(\"abba\")==('Found a match!')", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
