{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "original_task_id": 453, "entry_point": "sumofFactors", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the sum of even factors of a number.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sumofFactors(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the sum of even factors of a number.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "import math \r\ndef sumofFactors(n) : \r\n    if (n % 2 != 0) : \r\n        return 0\r\n    res = 1\r\n    for i in range(2, (int)(math.sqrt(n)) + 1) :    \r\n        count = 0\r\n        curr_sum = 1\r\n        curr_term = 1\r\n        while (n % i == 0) : \r\n            count= count + 1\r\n            n = n // i \r\n            if (i == 2 and count == 1) : \r\n                curr_sum = 0\r\n            curr_term = curr_term * i \r\n            curr_sum = curr_sum + curr_term \r\n        res = res * curr_sum  \r\n    if (n >= 2) : \r\n        res = res * (1 + n) \r\n    return res ", "tests": "assert sumofFactors(18) == 26\nassert sumofFactors(30) == 48\nassert sumofFactors(6) == 8", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
