{"task_id": "Mbpp/498", "original_task_id": 498, "entry_point": "gcd", "prompt": "Write a python function to find gcd of two positive integers.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef gcd(x, y):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find gcd of two positive integers.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def gcd(x, y):\r\n    gcd = 1\r\n    if x % y == 0:\r\n        return y\r\n    for k in range(int(y / 2), 0, -1):\r\n        if x % k == 0 and y % k == 0:\r\n            gcd = k\r\n            break  \r\n    return gcd", "tests": "assert gcd(12, 17) == 1\nassert gcd(4,6) == 2\nassert gcd(2,9) == 1", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
