{"task_id": "Mbpp/500", "original_task_id": 500, "entry_point": "concatenate_elements", "prompt": "Write a function to concatenate all elements of the given list into a string.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef concatenate_elements(list):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to concatenate all elements of the given list into a string.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def concatenate_elements(list):\r\n  ans = ' '\r\n  for i in list:\r\n    ans = ans+ ' '+i\r\n  return (ans) ", "tests": "assert concatenate_elements(['hello','there','have','a','rocky','day'] ) == '  hello there have a rocky day'\nassert concatenate_elements([ 'Hi', 'there', 'How','are', 'you'] ) == '  Hi there How are you'\nassert concatenate_elements([ 'Part', 'of', 'the','journey', 'is', 'end'] ) == '  Part of the journey is end'", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/501", "original_task_id": 501, "entry_point": "num_comm_div", "prompt": "Write a python function to find common divisor between two numbers in a given pair.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef num_comm_div(x, y):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find common divisor between two numbers in a given pair.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def ngcd(x,y):\r\n    i=1\r\n    while(i<=x and i<=y):\r\n        if(x%i==0 and y%i == 0):\r\n            gcd=i;\r\n        i+=1\r\n    return gcd;\r\ndef num_comm_div(x,y):\r\n  n = ngcd(x,y)\r\n  result = 0\r\n  z = int(n**0.5)\r\n  i = 1\r\n  while(i <= z):\r\n    if(n % i == 0):\r\n      result += 2 \r\n      if(i == n/i):\r\n        result-=1\r\n    i+=1\r\n  return result", "tests": "assert num_comm_div(2,4) == 2\nassert num_comm_div(2,8) == 2\nassert num_comm_div(12,24) == 6", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "eval", "original_split": "test", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
