{"task_id": "Mbpp/687", "split": "calibration", "source_fields": {"task_id": 687, "text": "Write a function to find the greatest common divisor (gcd) of two integers by using recursion.", "code": "def recur_gcd(a, b):\r\n\tlow = min(a, b)\r\n\thigh = max(a, b)\r\n\tif low == 0:\r\n\t\treturn high\r\n\telif low == 1:\r\n\t\treturn 1\r\n\telse:\r\n\t\treturn recur_gcd(low, high%low)", "test_list": ["assert recur_gcd(12,14) == 2", "assert recur_gcd(13,17) == 1", "assert recur_gcd(9, 3) == 3"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
