{"task_id": "Mbpp/701", "split": "calibration", "source_fields": {"task_id": 701, "text": "Write a function to find the equilibrium index of the given array.", "code": "def equilibrium_index(arr):\r\n  total_sum = sum(arr)\r\n  left_sum=0\r\n  for i, num in enumerate(arr):\r\n    total_sum -= num\r\n    if left_sum == total_sum:\r\n      return i\r\n    left_sum += num\r\n  return -1", "test_list": ["assert equilibrium_index([1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, 3]) == 3", "assert equilibrium_index([-7, 1, 5, 2, -4, 3, 0]) == 3", "assert equilibrium_index([1, 2, 3]) == -1"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
