{"task_id": "Mbpp/702", "split": "validation", "source_fields": {"task_id": 702, "text": "Write a function to find the minimum number of elements that should be removed such that amax-amin<=k.", "code": "def find_ind(key, i, n, \r\n\t\t\tk, arr):\r\n\tind = -1\r\n\tstart = i + 1\r\n\tend = n - 1;\r\n\twhile (start < end):\r\n\t\tmid = int(start +\r\n\t\t\t\t(end - start) / 2)\r\n\t\tif (arr[mid] - key <= k):\r\n\t\t\tind = mid\r\n\t\t\tstart = mid + 1\r\n\t\telse:\r\n\t\t\tend = mid\r\n\treturn ind\r\ndef removals(arr, n, k):\r\n\tans = n - 1\r\n\tarr.sort()\r\n\tfor i in range(0, n):\r\n\t\tj = find_ind(arr[i], i, \r\n\t\t\t\t\tn, k, arr)\r\n\t\tif (j != -1):\r\n\t\t\tans = min(ans, n -\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t(j - i + 1))\r\n\treturn ans", "test_list": ["assert removals([1, 3, 4, 9, 10,11, 12, 17, 20], 9, 4) == 5", "assert removals([1, 5, 6, 2, 8], 5, 2) == 3", "assert removals([1, 2, 3 ,4, 5, 6], 6, 3) == 2"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
