{"task_id": "Mbpp/747", "split": "validation", "source_fields": {"task_id": 747, "text": "Write a function to find the longest common subsequence for the given three string sequence.", "code": "def lcs_of_three(X, Y, Z, m, n, o): \r\n\tL = [[[0 for i in range(o+1)] for j in range(n+1)] \r\n\t\tfor k in range(m+1)] \r\n\tfor i in range(m+1): \r\n\t\tfor j in range(n+1): \r\n\t\t\tfor k in range(o+1): \r\n\t\t\t\tif (i == 0 or j == 0 or k == 0): \r\n\t\t\t\t\tL[i][j][k] = 0\r\n\t\t\t\telif (X[i-1] == Y[j-1] and\r\n\t\t\t\t\tX[i-1] == Z[k-1]): \r\n\t\t\t\t\tL[i][j][k] = L[i-1][j-1][k-1] + 1\r\n\t\t\t\telse: \r\n\t\t\t\t\tL[i][j][k] = max(max(L[i-1][j][k], \r\n\t\t\t\t\tL[i][j-1][k]), \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tL[i][j][k-1]) \r\n\treturn L[m][n][o]", "test_list": ["assert lcs_of_three('AGGT12', '12TXAYB', '12XBA', 6, 7, 5) == 2", "assert lcs_of_three('Reels', 'Reelsfor', 'ReelsforReels', 5, 8, 13) == 5 ", "assert lcs_of_three('abcd1e2', 'bc12ea', 'bd1ea', 7, 6, 5) == 3"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
