{"task_id": "Mbpp/684", "split": "train", "source_fields": {"task_id": 684, "text": "Write a python function to count occurences of a character in a repeated string.", "code": "def count_Char(str,x): \r\n    count = 0\r\n    for i in range(len(str)):  \r\n        if (str[i] == x) : \r\n            count += 1\r\n    n = 10\r\n    repititions = n // len(str)  \r\n    count = count * repititions  \r\n    l = n % len(str)  \r\n    for i in range(l): \r\n        if (str[i] == x):  \r\n            count += 1\r\n    return count  ", "test_list": ["assert count_Char(\"abcac\",'a') == 4", "assert count_Char(\"abca\",'c') == 2", "assert count_Char(\"aba\",'a') == 7"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
