{"task_id": "Mbpp/685", "split": "train", "source_fields": {"task_id": 685, "text": "Write a python function to find sum of prime numbers between 1 to n.", "code": "def sum_Of_Primes(n): \r\n    prime = [True] * (n + 1)  \r\n    p = 2\r\n    while p * p <= n: \r\n        if prime[p] == True:  \r\n            i = p * 2\r\n            while i <= n: \r\n                prime[i] = False\r\n                i += p \r\n        p += 1    \r\n    sum = 0\r\n    for i in range (2,n + 1): \r\n        if(prime[i]): \r\n            sum += i \r\n    return sum", "test_list": ["assert sum_Of_Primes(10) == 17", "assert sum_Of_Primes(20) == 77", "assert sum_Of_Primes(5) == 10"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
