{"task_id": "Mbpp/54", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 54, "text": "Write a function to sort the given array by using counting sort.", "code": "def counting_sort(my_list):\r\n    max_value = 0\r\n    for i in range(len(my_list)):\r\n        if my_list[i] > max_value:\r\n            max_value = my_list[i]\r\n    buckets = [0] * (max_value + 1)\r\n    for i in my_list:\r\n        buckets[i] += 1\r\n    i = 0\r\n    for j in range(max_value + 1):\r\n         for a in range(buckets[j]):\r\n             my_list[i] = j\r\n             i += 1\r\n    return my_list", "test_list": ["assert counting_sort([1,23,4,5,6,7,8]) == [1, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 23]", "assert counting_sort([12, 9, 28, 33, 69, 45]) == [9, 12, 28, 33, 45, 69]", "assert counting_sort([8, 4, 14, 3, 2, 1]) == [1, 2, 3, 4, 8, 14]"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
