{"task_id": "Mbpp/56", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 56, "text": "Write a python function to check if a given number is one less than twice its reverse.", "code": "def rev(num):    \r\n    rev_num = 0\r\n    while (num > 0):  \r\n        rev_num = (rev_num * 10 + num % 10) \r\n        num = num // 10  \r\n    return rev_num  \r\ndef check(n):    \r\n    return (2 * rev(n) == n + 1)  ", "test_list": ["assert check(70) == False", "assert check(23) == False", "assert check(73) == True"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
