{"task_id": "Mbpp/83", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 83, "text": "Write a python function to find the character made by adding all the characters of the given string.", "code": "def get_Char(strr):  \r\n    summ = 0\r\n    for i in range(len(strr)): \r\n        summ += (ord(strr[i]) - ord('a') + 1)  \r\n    if (summ % 26 == 0): \r\n        return ord('z') \r\n    else: \r\n        summ = summ % 26\r\n        return chr(ord('a') + summ - 1)", "test_list": ["assert get_Char(\"abc\") == \"f\"", "assert get_Char(\"gfg\") == \"t\"", "assert get_Char(\"ab\") == \"c\""], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
