{"task_id": "Mbpp/101", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 101, "text": "Write a function to find the kth element in the given array.", "code": "def kth_element(arr, n, k):\r\n  for i in range(n):\r\n    for j in range(0, n-i-1):\r\n      if arr[j] > arr[j+1]:\r\n        arr[j], arr[j+1] == arr[j+1], arr[j]\r\n  return arr[k-1]", "test_list": ["assert kth_element([12,3,5,7,19], 5, 2) == 3", "assert kth_element([17,24,8,23], 4, 3) == 8", "assert kth_element([16,21,25,36,4], 5, 4) == 36"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
