{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 103, "text": "Write a function to find eulerian number a(n, m).", "code": "def eulerian_num(n, m): \r\n\tif (m >= n or n == 0): \r\n\t\treturn 0 \r\n\tif (m == 0): \r\n\t\treturn 1 \r\n\treturn ((n - m) * eulerian_num(n - 1, m - 1) +(m + 1) * eulerian_num(n - 1, m))", "test_list": ["assert eulerian_num(3, 1) == 4", "assert eulerian_num(4, 1) == 11", "assert eulerian_num(5, 3) == 26"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
