{"task_id": "Mbpp/113", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 113, "text": "Write a function to check if a string represents an integer or not.", "code": "def check_integer(text):\r\n text = text.strip()\r\n if len(text) < 1:\r\n    return None\r\n else:\r\n     if all(text[i] in \"0123456789\" for i in range(len(text))):\r\n          return True\r\n     elif (text[0] in \"+-\") and \\\r\n         all(text[i] in \"0123456789\" for i in range(1,len(text))):\r\n         return True\r\n     else:\r\n        return False", "test_list": ["assert check_integer(\"python\")==False", "assert check_integer(\"1\")==True", "assert check_integer(\"12345\")==True"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
