{"task_id": "Mbpp/164", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 164, "text": "Write a python function to check whether the sum of divisors are same or not.", "code": "import math \r\ndef divSum(n): \r\n    sum = 1; \r\n    i = 2; \r\n    while(i * i <= n): \r\n        if (n % i == 0): \r\n            sum = (sum + i +math.floor(n / i)); \r\n        i += 1; \r\n    return sum; \r\ndef areEquivalent(num1,num2): \r\n    return divSum(num1) == divSum(num2); ", "test_list": ["assert areEquivalent(36,57) == False", "assert areEquivalent(2,4) == False", "assert areEquivalent(23,47) == True"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
