{"task_id": "Mbpp/331", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 331, "text": "Write a python function to count unset bits of a given number.", "code": "def count_unset_bits(n): \r\n    count = 0\r\n    x = 1\r\n    while(x < n + 1): \r\n        if ((x & n) == 0): \r\n            count += 1\r\n        x = x << 1\r\n    return count  ", "test_list": ["assert count_unset_bits(2) == 1", "assert count_unset_bits(4) == 2", "assert count_unset_bits(6) == 1"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
