{"task_id": "Mbpp/421", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 421, "text": "Write a function to concatenate each element of tuple by the delimiter.", "code": "def concatenate_tuple(test_tup):\r\n    delim = \"-\"\r\n    res = ''.join([str(ele) + delim for ele in test_tup])\r\n    res = res[ : len(res) - len(delim)]\r\n    return (str(res)) ", "test_list": ["assert concatenate_tuple((\"ID\", \"is\", 4, \"UTS\") ) == 'ID-is-4-UTS'", "assert concatenate_tuple((\"QWE\", \"is\", 4, \"RTY\") ) == 'QWE-is-4-RTY'", "assert concatenate_tuple((\"ZEN\", \"is\", 4, \"OP\") ) == 'ZEN-is-4-OP'"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
