{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 428, "text": "Write a function to sort the given array by using shell sort.", "code": "def shell_sort(my_list):\r\n    gap = len(my_list) // 2\r\n    while gap > 0:\r\n        for i in range(gap, len(my_list)):\r\n            current_item = my_list[i]\r\n            j = i\r\n            while j >= gap and my_list[j - gap] > current_item:\r\n                my_list[j] = my_list[j - gap]\r\n                j -= gap\r\n            my_list[j] = current_item\r\n        gap //= 2\r\n\r\n    return my_list", "test_list": ["assert shell_sort([12, 23, 4, 5, 3, 2, 12, 81, 56, 95]) == [2, 3, 4, 5, 12, 12, 23, 56, 81, 95]", "assert shell_sort([24, 22, 39, 34, 87, 73, 68]) == [22, 24, 34, 39, 68, 73, 87]", "assert shell_sort([32, 30, 16, 96, 82, 83, 74]) == [16, 30, 32, 74, 82, 83, 96]"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
