{"task_id": "Mbpp/475", "split": "eval", "source_fields": {"task_id": 475, "text": "Write a function to sort counter by value.", "code": "from collections import Counter\r\ndef sort_counter(dict1):\r\n x = Counter(dict1)\r\n sort_counter=x.most_common()\r\n return sort_counter", "test_list": ["assert sort_counter({'Math':81, 'Physics':83, 'Chemistry':87})==[('Chemistry', 87), ('Physics', 83), ('Math', 81)]", "assert sort_counter({'Math':400, 'Physics':300, 'Chemistry':250})==[('Math', 400), ('Physics', 300), ('Chemistry', 250)]", "assert sort_counter({'Math':900, 'Physics':1000, 'Chemistry':1250})==[('Chemistry', 1250), ('Physics', 1000), ('Math', 900)]"], "test_setup_code": "", "challenge_test_list": []}}
