{"task_id": "Mbpp/684", "original_task_id": 684, "entry_point": "count_Char", "prompt": "Write a python function to count occurences of a character in a repeated string.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef count_Char(str, x):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to count occurences of a character in a repeated string.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def count_Char(str,x): \r\n    count = 0\r\n    for i in range(len(str)):  \r\n        if (str[i] == x) : \r\n            count += 1\r\n    n = 10\r\n    repititions = n // len(str)  \r\n    count = count * repititions  \r\n    l = n % len(str)  \r\n    for i in range(l): \r\n        if (str[i] == x):  \r\n            count += 1\r\n    return count  ", "tests": "assert count_Char(\"abcac\",'a') == 4\nassert count_Char(\"abca\",'c') == 2\nassert count_Char(\"aba\",'a') == 7", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
