{"task_id": "Mbpp/953", "original_task_id": 953, "entry_point": "subset", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the minimun number of subsets with distinct elements.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef subset(ar, n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the minimun number of subsets with distinct elements.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def subset(ar, n): \r\n    res = 0\r\n    ar.sort() \r\n    for i in range(0, n) : \r\n        count = 1\r\n        for i in range(n - 1): \r\n            if ar[i] == ar[i + 1]: \r\n                count+=1\r\n            else: \r\n                break \r\n        res = max(res, count)  \r\n    return res ", "tests": "assert subset([1, 2, 3, 4],4) == 1\nassert subset([5, 6, 9, 3, 4, 3, 4],7) == 2\nassert subset([1, 2, 3 ],3) == 1", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
