{"task_id": "Mbpp/659", "original_task_id": 659, "entry_point": "Repeat", "prompt": "Write a python function to print duplicants from a list of integers.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef Repeat(x):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to print duplicants from a list of integers.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def Repeat(x): \r\n    _size = len(x) \r\n    repeated = [] \r\n    for i in range(_size): \r\n        k = i + 1\r\n        for j in range(k, _size): \r\n            if x[i] == x[j] and x[i] not in repeated: \r\n                repeated.append(x[i]) \r\n    return repeated ", "tests": "assert Repeat([10, 20, 30, 20, 20, 30, 40, 50, -20, 60, 60, -20, -20]) == [20, 30, -20, 60]\nassert Repeat([-1, 1, -1, 8]) == [-1]\nassert Repeat([1, 2, 3, 1, 2,]) == [1, 2]", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
